slation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਕਿਤੇ ਯੋਧਿਆਂ ਦੇ ਚੌਰ ਅਤੇ ਬਸਤ੍ਰ (ਡਿਗੇ ਪਏ ਹਨ)।"}}},{"verse_id":99245,"page_no":581,"line_no":99245,"gurmukhi":"ਕਹੂੰ ਸੁਧ ਸੇਲ ਸਨਾਹ ॥੩੦੪॥","translit_en":"kahoo(n) sudh sel sanaeh ||304||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"There are heaps of chopped limbs lying somewhere and somewhere there are lying arrows and swords, somewhere there are seen garments, somewhere lances and somewhere armours of steel.304."},"pu":{"ss":"ਕਿਤੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਨੇਜ਼ੇ ਅਤੇ ਕਵਚ (ਟੁਟੇ ਪਏ ਹਨ) ॥੩੦੪॥"}}},{"verse_id":99246,"page_no":581,"line_no":99246,"gurmukhi":"ਰਣਿ ਅੰਗ ਰੰਗਤ ਐਸ ॥","translit_en":"ran a(n)g ra(n)gat aais ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਯੁੱਧ-ਭੂਮੀ ਵਿਚ (ਸੂਰਮਿਆਂ ਦੇ) ਅੰਗ ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਰੰਗੇ ਪਏ ਹਨ,"}}},{"verse_id":99247,"page_no":581,"line_no":99247,"gurmukhi":"ਜਨੁ ਫੁਲ ਕਿੰਸਕ ਜੈਸ ॥","translit_en":"jan ful ki(n)sak jais ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਮਾਨੋ (ਜਿਵੇਾਂ) ਕੇਸੂ ਦੇ ਫੁਲ (ਰੁਲ ਰਹੇ ਹੋਣ)।"}}},{"verse_id":99248,"page_no":581,"line_no":99248,"gurmukhi":"ਇਕ ਐਸ ਜੂਝ ਮਰੰਤ ॥","translit_en":"eik aais joojh mara(n)t ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਇਕ (ਯੋਧੇ) ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ ਜੂਝ ਕੇ ਮਰਦੇ ਹਨ,"}}},{"verse_id":99249,"page_no":581,"line_no":99249,"gurmukhi":"ਜਨੁ ਖੇਲਿ ਫਾਗੁ ਬਸੰਤ ॥੩੦੫॥","translit_en":"jan khel faag basa(n)t ||305||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"The warriors are dyed in the colour of war like the kinsuk flowers, some of them are dying while fighting as if they are playing Holi.305."},"pu":{"ss":"ਮਾਨੋ ਫਾਗ ਖੇਡ ਕੇ (ਥਕੇ ਹੋਏ ਲੇਟੇ ਹੋਣ) ॥੩੦੫॥"}}},{"verse_id":99250,"page_no":581,"line_no":99250,"gurmukhi":"ਇਕ ਧਾਇ ਆਇ ਪਰੰਤ ॥","translit_en":"eik dhai aai para(n)t ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਇਕ ਧਾਵਾ ਕਰ ਕੇ ਆ ਪੈਂਦੇ ਹਨ,"}}},{"verse_id":99251,"page_no":582,"line_no":99251,"gurmukhi":"ਪਗ ਦ੍ਵੈ ਨ ਭਾਗਿ ਚਲੰਤ ॥","translit_en":"pag dhavai na bhaag chala(n)t ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਦੋ ਕਦਮ ਵੀ ਭਜਦੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਹਨ।"}}},{"verse_id":99252,"page_no":582,"line_no":99252,"gurmukhi":"ਤਜਿ ਤ੍ਰਾਸ ਕਰਤ ਪ੍ਰਹਾਰ ॥","translit_en":"taj traas karat prahaar ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਡਰ ਨੂੰ ਛਡ ਕੇ ਵਾਰ ਕਰਦੇ ਹਨ,"}}},{"verse_id":99253,"page_no":582,"line_no":99253,"gurmukhi":"ਜਨੁ ਖੇਲ ਫਾਗਿ ਧਮਾਰ ॥੩੦੬॥","translit_en":"jan khel faag dhamaar ||306||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"Someone is coming running and is not retracing even two steps backwards, they are striking blows like playing Holi.306."},"pu":{"ss":"ਮਾਨੋ ਫਾਗ ਖੇਡ ਰਹੇ ਹੋਣ ॥੩੦੬॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9233,"next":9235}}